  "description": "Darnelix.Webp is a pure-C#, dependency-free WebP codec: decode and encode lossy, lossless, near-lossless and alpha WebP, still and animated, implemented from the WebP, VP8 and VP8L specifications with no native code and zero runtime dependencies. This package targets .NET 8, .NET 9 and .NET 10, with SIMD-accelerated DSP kernels on all three. Container metadata and animation parameters are edited with the companion command-line tool, packaged as Darnelix.Webp.Cli (webpx).",
